   "decoupler_reverse_flow": "low delta-T coils (3-4 F) draw more secondary flow than the running chillers' primary flow, so return water flows backwards through the decoupler and warms the secondary supply",
   "condenser_fouled": "chiller 1's condenser tubes scaled: its condenser approach about twice the 5 F design",
   "tower_fouled": "a fouled cooling tower: pinned at full fan with a wide approach (tower_full_fan), or holding its setpoint by running its fan harder (tower_controlled)"
  }
