 "known_issues": [
  "Synthetic: generated by CAMBER's own model of a plant, not measured. It shows what the rules see, not how a real plant behaves; never cite it as evidence about real buildings.",
  "Each scenario plant is four pieces of equipment (CH1, CH2, SECLOOP, TOWER, each <equip>__<scenario>) in one facility. chiller_staging_fleet pools every chiller it is given on one clock, so run it on one plant's two chillers at a time (an equipment filter in the config), never on the whole facility.",
  "The condenser and evaporator approaches are the chiller controller's refrigerant-side readings, emitted directly; the data carries no refrigerant pressures."
 ],
